    {
      "source": "Find a registered <a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> that supports\nthe given method parameter.",
      "translation": "查找一个已注册的、支持给定方法参数的<code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\">接口</a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Iterate over registered\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a> and\ninvoke the one that supports it.",
      "translation": "遍历已注册的 <a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a> 并调用支持它的那个。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves method parameters by delegating to a list of registered\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a>.\nPreviously resolved method parameters are cached for faster lookups.",
      "translation": "通过委托给已注册的`HandlerMethodArgumentResolver`列表来解析方法参数。<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a>。之前解析的方法参数会被缓存以加快查找速度。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Clear the list of configured resolvers and the resolver cache.",
      "translation": "清除已配置的解析器列表和解析器缓存。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a read-only list with the contained resolvers, or an empty list.",
      "translation": "返回包含解析器的只读列表，或返回空列表。",
      "count": 2
