      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if no suitable\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> is found.",
